rror message for invalid dates and\ntimes.\n\nExtracting the error message into a constant allows us to ensure that\nboth task types have the same message when we decide to change the\nmessage. Leaving it inline might cause us to forget to change the other\nwhen changing one.\n\nLet\u0027s extract out the common date time error message into a constant\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":5,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"0c018ffbdcc34cad8effc019e40e21376ebed688","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove Jimbo.run() and Jimbo.main()","messageBody":"Jimbo now uses a GUI instead of the terminal. Since the starting point\nof the app is now through JavaFX, Jimbo.main() and Jimbo.run() are\nnever called, so they are dead code.\n\nLet\u0027s remove Jimbo.run() and Jimbo.main() to improve code quality.\n\nRemoving the dead code keeps the code cleaner and easier to read.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":0,"deletions":27}}},{"hash":"48321740fe5b492b46e7381b04125b4040a024b0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract out additional parsing for each command","messageBody":"Parser.parse() is deeply nested and has multiple layers of abstraction.\nThis makes the code hard to read and maintain.\n\nLet\u0027s extract out the additional parsing for parameters for each\ncommand.\n\nThe additional parsing step is extracted out into a method so that\nin Parser.parse(), each command type will be handled at the same\nlevel of abstraction.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":109,"deletions":89}}},{"hash":"08416d0897baaccf1679a4e6e7bb655742131e59","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from Applehihi/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Merge branch-A-Assertions into master","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"027c21956e8eaaba85025c7c8f7e56e58268db53","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messag